scope one module function repaired and measured; four cold-open reds and one hot-pass red closed; one ledger row booked and withdrawn to a peer's earlier cure
status GREEN -- mantra_weave_merge, mantra_weave_annotate, mantra_weave_model, tame_style_check, width_check, shell_dialect, convergence_prove, reds_ledger_monotone, reds_ledger_headline, reds_row_present, log_has_a_row, unshared_citation, equinox_e123_living_pin_guard, fold_shelf_link_repoint, plus the hot roster pass. Cold open five red, four closed; hot pass three red, all mine and all closed; stash_record left open and named as another seat's.
recommend keep-going -- the read is linear now and the module's three shapes are all repaired, so the next crux in this lane is the anchor the card still names: what a merge is taken AGAINST when two weaves have no common history to point at.
